  Recommended migration order:
  1. Start with pkg/storage/unified/ (biggest impact per effort)
  2. Then pkg/services/accesscontrol/ (security/audit relevance)
  3. Remaining pkg/services/ packages in batches per domain
  4. pkg/api/ last (API layer should follow patterns set by services)

